     "construction": "f13a_mhd_check.hartmann_strip_mesh(Ha, k): base 2 x 16 cells on [0, 0.25] x [-1, 1], y nodes graded_nodes(16, 1, 1/Ha) (first interval = Hartmann-layer thickness); uniform for Ha = 0; corner cells flipped (Taylor-Hood condition); k red refinements (NESTED: the grading is fixed by the base mesh)",
     "h_definition": "h_nominal = 1/(16 * 2^k) (computational, base intervals halved per refinement); h_max reported"
    }
   },
